[gd_scene load_steps=13 format=3]

; The trainer's bed. A STAND-IN, and recorded as one.
;
; The extracted Quaternius Medieval Village subset contains no bed — 35 of the
; kit's 176 models are in the repo and none of them is furniture. Rather than
; dress a crate up as a bed and call it art, this is honest primitive geometry
; at honest dimensions: 1.00 x 2.00m footprint, 0.75m to the top of the
; headboard, against a 1.80m trainer. It occupies exactly one 2m build cell.
;
; It is not the answer to the owner's bar and must not be used to judge how the
; home reads. It exists so the bed's BEHAVIOUR — respawn point, rest point —
; can be built, seen and tested now.
;
; Replacing it is a one-line change to `model` in data/building/pieces.json,
; plus re-measuring the collider. Nothing in code names this file.

[sub_resource type="StandardMaterial3D" id="mat_wood"]
